    {
      "id": 82319,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-22T16:03:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I suspect that it is difficult to find an official quote about there being \"exactly two expansions after Vengance\" because that is just a paraphrasing of some things we have implied and not an absolute truth (because it depends on what you mean by \"expansion\"). Things that are true:</p><p>1) There is a \"regular\" expansion after Vengeance.</p><p>2) There is a \"final\" expansion to the card game story arc.</p><p>3) There are a few mini-expansions, accessories, and special expansion-like things that we have planned out and are super excited to publish, market willing.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:05:02.506Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
