      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "Chief Justice",
      "title_is_group": false,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I suspect that it is difficult to find an official quote about there being \"exactly two expansions after Vengance\" because that is just a paraphrasing of some things we have implied and not an absolute truth (because it depends on what you mean by \"expansion\"). Things that are true:</p><p>1) There is a \"regular\" expansion after Vengeance.</p><p>2) There is a \"final\" expansion to the card game story arc.</p><p>3) There are a few mini-expansions, accessories, and special expansion-like things that we have planned out and are super excited to publish, market willing.</p>",
